00:00:24.579 --> 00:00:28.449
&gt;&gt; I WAS SURPRISEED TO LEARN IN

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:30.484
1961 JON VOIGHT WAS IN THE

00:00:30.485 --> 00:00:32.720
