00:00:48.803 --> 00:00:50.938
SHE WASN'T.

00:00:50.939 --> 00:00:54.074
SHE WAS A GREAT LISTENER.

00:00:54.075 --> 00:00:56.644
WHEN I WAS ON STAGE WITH HER,

00:00:56.645 --> 00:00:59.613
SHE WAS LISTENING TO ME.

00:00:59.614 --> 00:01:01.649
SHE WAS RESPONDING TO ME.

00:01:01.650 --> 00:01:04.618
I WAS QUITE SURPRISED.

00:01:04.619 --> 00:01:07.454
THE FIRST NOTE I GOT, AFTER MY

00:01:07.455 --> 00:01:08.455
FIRST PERFORMANCE, I WAS VERY

00:01:08.456 --> 00:01:11.625
GOOD IN THAT PERFORMANCE.

00:01:11.626 --> 00:01:13.827
THE ENERGY WAS HIGH.

00:01:13.828 --> 00:01:15.963
THE ADRENALINE WAS WORKING.

00:01:15.964 --> 00:01:17.431
I GAVE A PRETTY GOOD

00:01:17.432 --> 00:01:17.831
PERFORMANCE.

00:01:17.832 --> 00:01:19.233
I GOT ONE NOTE.

00:01:19.234 --> 00:01:24.638
IT SAID DON'T UPSTAGE MISS

00:01:24.639 --> 00:01:24.972
MARTIN.

00:01:24.973 --> 00:01:29.309
&gt;&gt; IN 1978 YOU WON AN OSCAR FOR

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:34.915
COMING HOME" WHICH CAPTURED EYE

00:01:34.916 --> 00:01:38.318
VIETNAM VET WHO WAS PARALYZED.

00:01:38.319 --> 00:01:43.857
WHAT CHANGED IN YOU?

00:01:43.858 --> 00:01:51.165
DID IT SENSITIZE YOU FROM THE

00:01:51.166 --> 00:01:57.371
SOLDIERS COMING HOME FROM

00:01:57.372 --> 00:01:57.705
VIETNAM?

00:01:57.706 --> 00:02:02.376
&gt;&gt; I WAS A LIBERAL BUT I WAS IN

00:02:02.377 --> 00:02:02.876
TRANSITION.

00:02:02.877 --> 00:02:11.285
I WAS SHOCKED.

00:02:11.286 --> 00:02:12.586
VIETNAM CELEBRATED THAT AS A

00:02:12.587 --> 00:02:12.953
VICTORY.

00:02:12.954 --> 00:02:15.155
YOU ARE NOT PAYING ATTENTION TO

00:02:15.156 --> 00:02:18.425
THE HORROR THAT WAS CREATED WHEN

00:02:18.426 --> 00:02:20.127
OUR PULLING OUT.

00:02:20.128 --> 00:02:24.331
I SPENT A LOT OF TIME IN A

00:02:24.332 --> 00:02:26.667
SPINAL CORD INJURY PLACE.

00:02:26.668 --> 00:02:27.801
I SPENT THE NIGHT.

00:02:27.802 --> 00:02:29.503
IN SOME OF THE ROOMS AND HEARD

00:02:29.504 --> 00:02:32.172
THE VOICES AND SOME OF THE MOANS

00:02:32.173 --> 00:02:34.541
AND STUFF OF THE PEOPLE WHO HAD

00:02:34.542 --> 00:02:39.146
THESE INJURIES.

00:02:39.147 --> 00:02:41.181
THEIR SUFFERING WAS WHAT I WAS

00:02:41.182 --> 00:02:44.451
SUPPOSED TO PORTRAY.

00:02:44.452 --> 00:02:46.887
I WAS TRYING TO GET THIS RIGHT

00:02:46.888 --> 00:02:49.623
FOR THESE GUYS.

00:02:49.624 --> 00:02:50.891
&gt;&gt; YOU DID.

00:02:50.892 --> 00:02:55.095
&gt;&gt; I JUST HAD THIS ACCIDENT WITH

00:02:55.096 --> 00:02:56.296
THE HELICOPTER.

00:02:56.297 --> 00:02:57.264
IN AFGHANISTAN.

00:02:57.265 --> 00:03:00.234
&gt;&gt; AND THE PRESIDENT TOOK YOU

00:03:00.235 --> 00:03:04.037
OUT TO DOVER TO RECEIVE THE

00:03:04.038 --> 00:03:04.671
BODDOS OF THE SOLDIERS?

00:03:04.672 --> 00:03:05.773
&gt;&gt; RIGHT.

00:03:05.774 --> 00:03:08.442
HE FELT I HAD EMPATHY FOR THE

00:03:08.443 --> 00:03:09.343
FAMILIES AND INVITED ME.

00:03:09.344 --> 00:03:10.744
WOULD YOU LIKE TO COME?

00:03:10.745 --> 00:03:14.581
YES, I WOULD LIKE TO SEE THAT

00:03:14.582 --> 00:03:16.450
CEREMONY PERFORMED AND SAY MY

00:03:16.451 --> 00:03:20.287
PRAYERS AND SALUTE THOSE

00:03:20.288 --> 00:03:20.621
CASKETS.

00:03:20.622 --> 00:03:26.226
&gt;&gt; THE CEREMONY, THERE IS AN ART

00:03:26.227 --> 00:03:26.827
TO IT.

00:03:26.828 --> 00:03:30.197
I WAS SO GRATEFUL TO BE THERE.

00:03:30.198 --> 00:03:32.633
&gt;&gt; IT'S AN INCREDIBLE THING TO

00:03:32.634 --> 00:03:32.966
WITNESS.

00:03:32.967 --> 00:03:35.202
&gt;&gt; THAT RITUAL, THAT ART MADE

00:03:35.203 --> 00:03:36.637
THE STATEMENT OF OUR RESPECT AND

00:03:36.638 --> 00:03:38.939
OUR GRATITUDE FOR THE SACRIFICES

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:42.042
OF OUR MILITARY.

00:03:42.043 --> 00:03:45.045
I AM SURE THE DIGNITY WAS

00:03:45.046 --> 00:03:46.580
AFFECTING TO THOSE FAMILIES.

00:03:46.581 --> 00:03:52.119
&gt;&gt; YOU PLAYED JOHN PAUL II AND

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:57.191
FDR, HOWARD COSSEL AND NOW THIS

00:03:57.192 --> 00:04:00.794
EX-CONNICKY DONOVAN WHO IS THE

00:04:00.795 --> 00:04:01.528
STAR.

00:04:01.529 --> 00:04:04.631
I UPON RAY IS THE STAR.

00:04:04.632 --> 00:04:07.734
THIS ROLE HE IS SLY AND

00:04:07.735 --> 00:04:08.769
DANGEROUS.

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:12.239
WHERE DID THIS COME FROM?

00:04:12.240 --> 00:04:14.074
&gt;&gt; [LAUGHING].

00:04:14.075 --> 00:04:16.577
WHERE DOES IT COME FROM?

00:04:16.578 --> 00:04:17.477
SOMEBODY WROTE THIS TERRIBLE

00:04:17.478 --> 00:04:20.581
CHARACTER AND I EMBODY IT.

00:04:20.582 --> 00:04:23.817
YOU GO TO EMMY EVENTS AND

00:04:23.818 --> 00:04:25.118
INTERACT WITH PEOPLE.

00:04:25.119 --> 00:04:28.422
THEY ASK ME HOW DID YOU COME TO

00:04:28.423 --> 00:04:29.957
THIS ROLE?

00:04:29.958 --> 00:04:31.191
I SAY I DO THIS AND TALK ABOUT

00:04:31.192 --> 00:04:34.094
THE WORK I DID AS A BOXER.

00:04:34.095 --> 00:04:38.332
THE PHYSICALITY THE WAY I WALK.

00:04:38.333 --> 00:04:41.168
THEN I JUST GO OUT AND I AM

00:04:41.169 --> 00:04:41.602
MYSELF.

00:04:41.603 --> 00:04:43.170
&gt;&gt; WHAT IS JON VOIGHT'S LEGACY?

00:04:43.171 --> 00:04:45.706
&gt;&gt; I WOULD LIKE TO DISAPPEAR

00:04:45.707 --> 00:04:49.309
FROM JON VOIGHT AND BE JUST A

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:53.580
SOURCE OF TRUTHFUL ABOVE

00:04:53.581 --> 00:04:54.715
INSTEPPED AN ACTOR.

00:04:54.716 --> 00:04:58.285
I HAVE A GREAT LOVE FOR MY PAST,

00:04:58.286 --> 00:05:00.387
MY DAD, MY FAMILY.

00:05:00.388 --> 00:05:01.688
AND THE PEOPLE THAT I HAVE BEEN

00:05:01.689 --> 00:05:05.125
FORTUNATE TO BE ASSOCIATED WITH

00:05:05.126 --> 00:05:06.093
DURING MY CAREER.

00:05:06.094 --> 00:05:08.562
I CAN'T WIPE THAT AWAY.

00:05:08.563 --> 00:05:12.232
&gt;&gt; THROUGH YOUR WORK YOU ARE A

00:05:12.233 --> 00:05:18.006
SOURCE OF TRUTH.

